# S12: Multi-User Presence

## Objective

Wire the existing `presence.sync` WcEvent (defined S05, never emitted) into a real
real-time awareness layer. Users and running agents appear as live avatar stacks on
the chat and board pages. No edit-locking — awareness only. Pre-auth: ephemeral tab IDs.

## Prerequisites

- S11 CLOSED (WS + activity log stable)
- `presence.sync` type exists in `shared/ws.ts` (S05 §4)
- Broadcast hub (`realtime.ts`) unchanged transport

