- [x] S12-T01-FreezeInvariants.pd
- [x] S12-T02-PresenceRegistry.pd
- [x] S12-T03-PresenceBroadcast.pd
- [x] S12-T04-EphemeralIdentity.pd
- [x] S12-T05-AvatarStackUI.pd
- [x] S12-T06-AgentPresence.pd
- [x] S12-T07-CollaborationRules.pd
- [x] S12-T08-KnowledgeUpdate.pd
- [x] S12-T09-TestsSmoke.pd

## Definition of Done

- [x] Two browser tabs on same board see each other's avatars live
- [x] Running mock agent appears in board presence for task duration
- [x] Chat page shows presence for active viewers
- [x] No edit-locking introduced (awareness-no-lock invariant §3)
- [x] `bun run test` green, `bun run feature:health` green
- [x] `S12-SUMMARY.md` written, `SPRINT-ROADMAP.md` updated

